  "headline": "Zoledronic acid is not on FDA's shortage list as of 2026-10-21; Corvale East has 11 days on hand and Corvale General has 31.7 days on hand",
  "headline_cites": ["D3", "D1", "D2"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's records show zoledronic acid is not on the drug shortage list as of 2026-10-21.",
      "cites": ["D3"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 36 vials of the 4 mg/100 mL presentation with 3.3 vials used per day, giving 11 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D1"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale General holds 89 vials of the same presentation with 2.8 vials used per day, giving 31.7 days on hand.",
      "cites": ["D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The product label for NDC 68083014201 names Gland Pharma Limited as the manufacturing plant (FEI 3002647489) in India.",
      "cites": ["E9"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA inspection 1244548 at that plant ended 2024-07-25 and was classified VAI, with the classification known on 2025-01-15.",
      "cites": ["E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-based best option is to buy from Accord Healthcare Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and whose label names no plant we could place.",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    }
  ]
}
